  "notes": "A verb expressing contempt or condescension toward others.\n\nTRANSITIVITY:\n- Type: {他動詞|たどうし} (transitive)\n\nCOMMON PATTERNS:\n- {人|ひと}を{見下|みくだ}す (to look down on people)\n- {見下|みくだ}すような{態度|たいど} (condescending attitude)\n- {見下|みくだ}した{目|め}で{見|み}る (to look at with disdain)\n\nRELATED TERMS:\n- {見下|みお}ろす: to look down from above (physical)\n- {軽蔑|けいべつ}する: to despise\n- {蔑|さげす}む: to scorn",
